  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell clouds the mind of a humanoid creature with 4 or fewer Hit Dice so that it takes no actions. Humanoids of 5 or more HD are not affected. A dazed subject is not stunned, so attackers get no special advantage against it. After a creature has been dazed by this spell, it is immune to the effects of this spell for 1 minute.",
    "search_text": "\"this spell clouds the mind of a humanoid creature with 4 or fewer hit dice so that it takes no actions. humanoids of 5 or more hd are not affected. a dazed subject is not stunned, so attackers get no special advantage against it. after a creature has been dazed by this spell, it is immune to the effects of this spell for 1 minute.\"",
